      "spam": false,
      "value": "If you have every attempted to make an avatar for Second Life (making a mesh that is), High Fidelity, or even Sansar... you will then start to agree that VRchat currently has the easiest method of importing avatars into the game, compared to those others mentioned.\n\nI never used Unity before, but with a few easy to follow tutorials it was actually easy, took some trial and error, but Unity makes the process more stream lined, because it will attempt to match bones with Unity's.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
