  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-12T06:57:34.441Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "i have been playing VRChat for about a week and the game is great. especially with friends...\n\nbut there is one flaw with the game, the way you import custom avatars and maps is really complicated, if you are a new user it is daunting and hard to get a custom avatar/map working, worse if you don't know unity, the one way i see that you could resolve this is by creating a app that automatically downloads avatars from a dedicated website and imports them into the game. this will make it easier for users to get a custom avatar/map working without having to learn unity or try via trial and error as this will drive away users from wanting to play the game. this feature might be annoying to get working but it will allow more users to have a custom avatar or play on a custom map, if this is implemented this would make a awesome game into a god-like game...\nthanks for reading guys!",
